Reality check 2026-10-14 (refinement), lower-severity reporting items to fold into the children:
- roll-forward and GL detail use the migration STAGING sequence instead of the activation sequence (roll_forward.rs:212);
- aging workpapers take unit and account metadata from current state, not certified bytes (aging/certificate/export.rs:254-262);
